  "remarks": "Trans KA Tankers Management Company Limited is a shipping company based in Türkiye and is the commercial operator of the vessels Haci Kemal Ka, Lycia Ka and Sumer. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and engage in manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, Trans KA Tankers Management Company Limited operates vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
